      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#ffe07a>T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c</color>\n  F: N\xF3i chuy\u1EC7n \xB7 L\xF2 R\xE8n \xB7 \u0110\xE1 Truy\u1EC1n T\u1ED1ng\n  B / C: Nh\xE2n v\u1EADt, trang b\u1ECB v\xE0 t\xFAi \u0111\u1ED3\n  J: B\xE1ch Khoa Tr\xF9m \xB7 Tab: \u0110\u1ED5i nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5\n  K: S\xE1ch Chi\xEAu (chi\xEAu h\u1ECDc t\u1EEB B\xED K\xEDp)\n  T: T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\xE1nh qu\xE1i \xB7 M: B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3\n  F1: H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn \xB7 Esc: T\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng\n\n<color=#ffe07a>M\u1EB9o chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u</color>\n  V\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t = \u0111\xF2n s\u1EAFp \u0111\xE1nh.\n  L\u01B0\u1EDBt (Space) ra ngo\xE0i v\xF2ng!\n\n<color=#ffe07a>Ph\xEDm th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m</color>\n  F5 h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EA7y \xB7 F6 \u0111\u1ED5i gi\u1EDD \xB7 F7 t\u1EDBi Boss\n  F8 v\u1EC1 l\xE0ng \xB7 F9 h\u1EA1 qu\xE1i g\u1EA7n"
